A. Vedesshwar is an Indian teenage filmmaker, editor, producer,
actor and content creator from Puducherry, India. He is the founder of
King Studios. He started his content creation journey as a YouTuber
in 2021 and later entered filmmaking in December 2024.
Career
Vedesshwar started creating gaming videos on YouTube in 2021 and gained
around 150 subscribers before his channel was banned in 2023.
In December 2024, he began making short films under his production banner
King Studios.
